# Feature Engineering Strategy: Tiered Framework (Tier 1 / 2 / 3)
# ===============================================================

## Why Use Tiering?

We organize features into tiers to:

1. Prevent data leakage
2. Measure incremental predictive value
3. Improve interpretability
4. Support model governance
5. Enable structured experimentation

This approach mirrors production risk modeling workflows.

---------------------------------------------------------------
Tier Definitions
---------------------------------------------------------------

Tier 1: Core Administrative Features
- Demographics (age, gender)
- Length of stay (LOS)
- Prior utilization metrics

Tier 2: Clinical Severity Features
- Diagnosis count
- Comorbidity indicators
- Procedure count
- ICU stay flag

Tier 3: Temporal Aggregation Features
- Lab abnormalities prior to discharge
- Medication counts
- Time-based summaries

All features must be available on or before discharge time.
